# Goblin Tomb Raider: "As long as you control an artifact, this creature gets +1/+0 and has haste."
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Raider with a Mountain and controls no artifact: it is a 1/2 without haste and is still summoning sick (CR 302.6). On turn 2 Bot2 casts a
# Mox Ruby, but "you control" means only the Raider's controller (CR 109.5), so the Raider stays a 1/2 without haste.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Goblin Tomb Raider
Plains x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Island x19

